    "Flipper.DiverterFlipper001 (raw normalized x=-0.139891, far outside playfield bounds, likely a parented-local-origin artifact) and Primitive.diverterwall_open/diverterwall_closed (raw position exactly 0,0,0) -- not used for solenoid 8/16 placement; that mechanism is projected onto switch 71's own validated position instead"
